{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/5439","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/5439/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/5439/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/5439/events","html_url":"https://github.com/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/5439","id":5698038480,"node_id":"I_kwDOSiSx0c8AAAABU6Eq0A","number":5439,"title":"Nested TypeScript package verify commands are copied without their package root","user":{"login":"EffortlessSteven","id":15812269,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODEyMjY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15812269?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven","html_url":"https://github.com/EffortlessSteven","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-04T09:36:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T09:36:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"For a TypeScript package below the repository root, `verify_command_for_discovery` (`crates/ripr/src/analysis/language/typescript/package.rs`) emits the test path relative to the package directory, and the record carries `typescript_package_root` evidence. The consumers that offer the command do not use that root:\n\n- VS Code `copyFirstPrVerifyCommand` copies the raw command;\n- `selected_command_context` in `crates/ripr/src/output/markdown.rs` wraps it with a `cd` to the repository root;\n- the LSP and actionable-queue copy actions copy it as is.\n\nPasted from the repository root, `npx --no-install jest tests/x.test.ts` misses the package's test, and `npm test -- tests/x.test.ts` runs the root package's script.\n\nBefore #5400 the editor refused every TypeScript verify command, so this gap was hidden. #5400 makes those commands copyable, which exposes it for nested packages. Single-package repositories are unaffected.\n\nAcceptance: the command a user copies for a nested-package record runs from the package root. Either the producer prefixes the command with the package root, or every consumer projects `typescript_package_root` as the working directory. Prove it with a nested-package fixture whose copied command names the package directory.\n\nFound by Devin review on #5400 (comment 4176922051).","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/5439/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/5439/timeline","performed_via_github_app":{"id":1236702,"client_id":"Iv23liqTIFEtdIu6Vn1r","slug":"claude","node_id":"A_kwHOBIuudM4AEt7e","owner":{"login":"anthropics","id":76263028,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbj